SUMMARY:Grocery Shopping for Upcoming Week's Meals
DESCRIPTION:GROCERY SHOPPING LIST\n==================================================\n\n• Cauliflower: 0.5 unit\n• Celery: 5 stalk\n• Chicken Thighs: 5 unit\n• Chili Pepper: 2 unit\n• Chopped Whole Chicken: 500 g\n• Cilantro: 2 small handful\n• Diced Pepper: 1 unit\n• Egg: 2 unit\n• Firm Tofu: 1 block\n• Fish: 1 unit\n• Garlic: 4 clove\n• Garlic Sprouts: 3 unit\n• Ginger: 5 thin piece\n• Green Onion: 2 unit\n• Green Onions: 3 unit\n• Green Pepper: 1 unit\n• Oyster Sauce: 1 tablespoon\n• Peeled And Seeded Sweet Pumpkin: 600 gram\n• Pixian Doubanjiang: 1 tablespoon\n• Salt: 1 teaspoon\n• Sesame Oil: 0.5 tablespoon\n• Soy Sauce: 5 tablespoon\n• Soybean Paste: 2 tablespoon\n• Sugar: 0.5 teaspoon\n• Tomatoes: 10 unit\n• Vegetable Oil: 2 tablespoon\n• Vinegar: 1 dessert spoon\n• White Sugar: 50 gram\n• Carrots: as needed\n• Chicken Essence: as needed\n• Ciba Chili Paste 糍粑辣椒: as needed\n• Cooking Oil: as needed\n• Dark Soy Sauce: as needed\n• Five-Spice Powder: as needed\n• Garlic Powder: as needed\n• Goji Berries: as needed\n• Ground Beef: as needed\n• Hot Pepper Sauce: as needed\n• Light Soy Sauce: as needed\n• Oil: as needed\n• Pepper: as needed\n• Red Dates: as needed\n• Scallions: as needed\n• Sweet Potato Vermicelli: as needed\n• Dried Mushrooms: Any (shiitake mushrooms\, bamboo fungus\, cordyceps flower\, tea tree mushrooms\, morels\, chanterelles\, king oyster mushrooms)\n• Peanuts: a handful\n• Starch: a pinch\n\nTotal ingredients: 47
